{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:698197f7b296c773","name":"Autonomy Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-698197f7b296c773","title":"Autonomy Talent Tree","revision":16043,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:33Z","sha256":"0d71c924ba55ecadeddfb2f31b38c36bb823626655186de68833c5a6727f6c66","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16043","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Autonomy%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-698197f7b296c773","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are able to resist any attempts to curb your independence and can fight back against anyone that tries to suppress your personality.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defensive Electronics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogram"}," you, add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Independent Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Independent_Droid","referenceId":"reference:6970f6ef6b1a6030"}," Class Level to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ion Resistance 10"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 10 against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Soft Reset"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at rerouting your internal electronics. If you are moved to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by any means other than taking damage exceeding your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you automatically move +1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," after being ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"}," for 2 rounds.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Modification Specialist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have become skilled at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogramming"}," and modifying your own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"},". You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogram"}," yourself or perform self-modifications.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Repair Self"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," yourself, you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repair"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repair"}," 1 additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," for each point by which your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check exceeds the DC.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Just a Droid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at passing yourself off as an ordinary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". You can use each of the following Actions once per encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Just Another Droid:"]}," You are skilled at using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," to sneak past unwary enemies when moving in plain sight. You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sneak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sneak"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," skill when in plain sight of an enemy, if the enemy has no reason to doubt that you are just another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," for this Action."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Just a Normal Droid:"]}," You can reroll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," checks for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," to make observers believe that you are carrying out a standard function when attempting to do something atypical for your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Model"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Model"}," or function. You may keep either result."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Swift Droid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," Any two Talents from the Autonomy Talent Tree\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You move quickly when caught. You can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," after failing a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
